{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "044ame_305_2_3_044_05_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:62d5a2750311f420207024f53fdaf666a211fb94d125b679e1a560e1184ccf9a",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:044ame_305_2_3_044_05_09_a:2_3_044_05_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:08063e84a1393eb3e9a15cc2ac214c2aed8a2d8145a89c5848a7b576392de28d",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，辛苦啦。\n今天的工作也顺利完成了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:044ame_305_2_3_044_05_09_a:2_3_044_05_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f99ba029771346cb307e8591f20a73661fa5ab845cb4f32bd28f912d04b5565c",
      "text": "我现在准备回去，\n正好路过车站前。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:044ame_305_2_3_044_05_09_a:2_3_044_05_09_a:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4d07477b2f1164a73cf6f8db2f3051d175271f6ab397c52e52006cf80c2450c",
      "text": "就是之前办游击突袭演出的地方。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:044ame_305_2_3_044_05_09_a:2_3_044_05_09_a:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45c52dc7f01c9fc41b9b1e8e062a0e411d97a679e79965665faf35fbc06ee2a8",
      "text": "当时就觉得挺干净的，虽然人来人往，\n现在也依旧干干净净的啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:044ame_305_2_3_044_05_09_a:2_3_044_05_09_a:cmd-000016:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e3ab02e21f5a44019237665d1724a14fb09a728601073e9a29fed9efd576d938",
      "text": "是打扫得很到位吗",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:044ame_305_2_3_044_05_09_a:2_3_044_05_09_a:cmd-000017:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:efb8e89d9f437428dfb071a8ee75421ad2973f91675896c87fa79e207abeb356",
      "text": "是一场如驱散乌云般精彩的演出",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:044ame_305_2_3_044_05_09_a:2_3_044_05_09_a:cmd-000020:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c47083e3409c83cdfd45483908fbaa7b6223a37a3e47afb4d0317097411a9083",
      "text": "哈哈，是啊。\n也许是有人在默默履行职责吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:044ame_305_2_3_044_05_09_a:2_3_044_05_09_a:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95adbee821bdc89ec6d98c1514ce933a03411765e43a32923f68673027394ffe",
      "text": "如果我们掀起的风暴也出了份力的话，\n那真是再好不过了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:044ame_305_2_3_044_05_09_a:2_3_044_05_09_a:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9a580e7df80b36238dd15e205d4f776006e90ec3c2b71bbf2a0ca5b4197a9fc",
      "text": "趁着这干净的氛围，我发现了样别致的小玩意儿。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:044ame_305_2_3_044_05_09_a:2_3_044_05_09_a:cmd-000030:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5fc78117c09484bfca7cb4a70b25ddd52678805a1b534e87f4f494de8ea44b40",
      "text": "像那天的气球一样，蓝色圆圆的果冻。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:044ame_305_2_3_044_05_09_a:2_3_044_05_09_a:cmd-000032:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23a099b17e454743fc35fdcab587ad6200e18e287ebbaf7e4dff2ce3a631a1a0",
      "text": "当伴手礼带回去吧。\n反正你这家伙，现在肯定还打算待在事务所吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:044ame_305_2_3_044_05_09_a:2_3_044_05_09_a:cmd-000034:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a967931921427717844b365600658bef4ac0fabbf1c6636e3dc3317be056d759",
      "text": "非常感谢\n让人回想起那片天空呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:044ame_305_2_3_044_05_09_a:2_3_044_05_09_a:cmd-000037:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6178569604a00750153db2e929dbe12cbc8df3f07aec3777536df6305adca152",
      "text": "要是能在工作间隙成为一剂清凉的慰藉，那就再好不过了。\n那么，稍微等我一下。晚点见。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
